WEBVTT

11:02.355 --> 11:04.232
(MEN LAUGHING)

11:05.399 --> 11:06.901
- Quick, Bran!
- Faster.

11:08.486 --> 11:10.488
Lord Stark!

11:12.531 --> 11:13.574
My lady.

11:14.617 --> 11:16.827
A guardsman just rode in from the hills.

11:16.953 --> 11:19.956
They've captured a deserter
from the Night's Watch.

11:23.251 --> 11:25.378
Get the lads to saddle their horses.

11:25.503 --> 11:27.463
Do you have to?

11:27.588 --> 11:29.674
He swore an oath, Cat.

11:29.799 --> 11:31.801
Law is law, my lady.
